{"id":"153cbc8487ace6fa","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_KCConseq.md","title":"KCConseq","display":"KCConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"KCConseq","parameters":["g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"KCConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：直觉主义命题。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ KCConseq g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FormsI g)\n  (and\n    (@ FmI a)\n    (forall w\n      (forall r\n        (forall v\n          (forall b\n            (forall x\n              (implies\n                (and (@ KCModel w r v b) (and (in x w) (forall c (implies (in c g) (@ KCSat w r v b x c)))))\n                (@ KCSat w r v b x a)))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315c023b0374de7d\" href=\"?note=315c023b0374de7d\" title=\"ZFC_FmI\">FmI</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08bae348e041d0d6\" href=\"?note=08bae348e041d0d6\" title=\"ZFC_FormsI\">FormsI</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4911f5764eb9236a\" href=\"?note=4911f5764eb9236a\" title=\"ZFC_KCModel\">KCModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b9cf2f9bd75277fa\" href=\"?note=b9cf2f9bd75277fa\" title=\"ZFC_KCSat\">KCSat</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ KCConseq g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmI","status":"resolved","id":"315c023b0374de7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_KCModel|KCModel]]；[[ZFC_KCSat|KCSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FormsI","status":"resolved","id":"08bae348e041d0d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_KCModel|KCModel]]；[[ZFC_KCSat|KCSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_KCModel","status":"resolved","id":"4911f5764eb9236a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_KCModel|KCModel]]；[[ZFC_KCSat|KCSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_KCSat","status":"resolved","id":"b9cf2f9bd75277fa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_KCModel|KCModel]]；[[ZFC_KCSat|KCSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1068,"backlinks":[{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_KCConseq|KCConseq]]"},{"id":"e8ee8e023386ab32","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_KCConseq|KCConseq]]"},{"id":"fb7ae8fca962c5cd","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_KCConseq|KCConseq]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","315c023b0374de7d","08bae348e041d0d6","4911f5764eb9236a","b9cf2f9bd75277fa","593f9bdab4d60707"]}